{"sections":[{"slug":"Ab-范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Ab-范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Ab-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Ab-范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\mathsf {Ab}$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴是指充实于</span> $\\mathsf{Ab}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/加性范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">加性范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">环</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">可视为只有一个对象的</span> $\\mathsf {Ab}$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">环的元素是这个对象到自身的态射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">乘法是态射的复合</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">此时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">态射的复合是双线性的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个条件等同于乘法分配律</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">任何</span> $\\mathsf {Ab}$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴中的一个对象有自同态环</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}